msgstr "El tiempo estimado fue"

#: includes/class-hostpn-post-type-accommodation.php:2010
#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:309
#: templates/public/hostpn-contract-view.php:90
msgid "THE GUEST"
msgstr "EL INVITADO"

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:284
msgid "The GUEST agrees to:"
msgstr "El HUÉSPED acepta:"

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:279
msgid ""
"The GUEST delivers to the OWNER <strong>[hostpn-contract-deposit-amount] "
"EUR</strong> ([hostpn-contract-deposit-words]) as a security deposit."
msgstr ""
"El HUÉSPED entrega al PROPIETARIO <strong>[hostpn-contract-deposit-amount] "
"EUR</strong> ([hostpn-contract-deposit-words]) como depósito de seguridad."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:298
msgid ""
"The GUEST shall be liable for any damage caused to the property, contents or "
"common areas during their stay, except for normal wear and tear."
msgstr ""
"El HUÉSPED será responsable de cualquier daño causado a la propiedad, su "
"contenido o las áreas comunes durante su estancia, excepto el desgaste "
"normal por el uso."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:258
msgid ""
"The GUEST wishes to stay temporarily in said property for tourist or holiday "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"El HUÉSPED desea alojarse temporalmente en dicha propiedad con fines "
"turísticos o vacacionales."

#: includes/class-hostpn-post-type-accommodation.php:2009
#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:238
#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:379
#: templates/public/hostpn-contract-view.php:89
msgid "THE LANDLORD"
msgstr "EL PROPIETARIO"

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:327
msgid ""
"The LANDLORD is the rightful owner of the property located at <strong>"
"[hostpn-accommodation-address]</strong>, <strong>[hostpn-accommodation-city]"
"</strong>."
msgstr ""
"El PROPIETARIO es el legítimo dueño de la propiedad ubicada en <strong>"
"[hostpn-accommodation-address]</strong>, <strong>[hostpn-accommodation-city]"
"</strong>."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:174
msgid ""
"The LANDLORD is the rightful owner/manager of the property located at "
"<strong>[hostpn-accommodation-address]</strong>, a flat consisting of "
"several rooms and common areas."
msgstr ""
"El PROPIETARIO es el legítimo propietario/administrador de la propiedad "
"ubicada en <strong>[hostpn-accommodation-address]</strong>, un piso que "
"consta de varias habitaciones y áreas comunes."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:181
msgid ""
"The LANDLORD leases to the TENANT the exclusive use of <strong>Room [hostpn-"
"room-name]</strong>, furnished as per the attached inventory, located in the "
"shared property at <strong>[hostpn-accommodation-address]</strong>."
msgstr ""
"El ARRENDADOR arrienda al ARRENDATARIO el uso exclusivo de la <strong>"
"Habitación [hostpn-room-name]</strong>, amueblada según el inventario "
"adjunto, ubicada en la propiedad compartida en <strong>[hostpn-accommodation-"
"address]</strong>."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:333
msgid ""
"The LANDLORD leases to the TENANT the property located at <strong>[hostpn-"
"accommodation-address]</strong>, <strong>[hostpn-accommodation-city]</strong>"
", for use as the TENANT's habitual and permanent residence."
msgstr ""
"El ARRENDADOR arrienda al ARRENDATARIO la propiedad ubicada en <strong>"
"[hostpn-accommodation-address]</strong>, <strong>[hostpn-accommodation-city]"
"</strong>, para uso como residencia habitual y permanente del ARRENDATARIO."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:359
msgid ""
"The LANDLORD shall carry out the necessary repairs to keep the property in "
"habitable condition, except for damage attributable to the TENANT."
msgstr ""
"El PROPIETARIO deberá realizar las reparaciones necesarias para mantener la "
"propiedad en condiciones habitables, excepto los daños atribuibles al "
"ARRENDATARIO."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:198
msgid ""
"The monthly rent includes water, community fees, property tax, waste "
"collection and broadband Internet."
msgstr ""
"El alquiler mensual incluye el agua, los gastos de comunidad, el impuesto "
"sobre la propiedad, la recogida de basuras e internet de banda ancha."

#: includes/class-hostpn-post-type-guest.php:96
#: includes/class-hostpn-functions-user.php:173
msgid ""
"The number/ID of the document that you set on \"Document type\" field just "
"above."
msgstr ""
"El número/ID del documento que usted configuró en el campo “Tipo de "
"documento” justo arriba."

#: includes/class-hostpn-post-type-accommodation.php:2009
#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:308
#: templates/public/hostpn-contract-view.php:89
msgid "THE OWNER"
msgstr "EL PROPIETARIO"

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:263
msgid ""
"The OWNER grants the temporary use of the tourist property located at "
"<strong>[hostpn-accommodation-address]</strong>, furnished and equipped as "
"per inventory, for the exclusive purpose of tourist accommodation."
msgstr ""
"El PROPIETARIO otorga el uso temporal de la propiedad turística ubicada en "
"<strong>[hostpn-accommodation-address]</strong>, amueblada y equipada según "
"inventario, para el propósito exclusivo de alojamiento turístico."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:257
msgid ""
"The OWNER is the rightful owner of the tourist accommodation property "
"located at <strong>[hostpn-accommodation-address]</strong>, <strong>[hostpn-"
"accommodation-city]</strong>."
msgstr ""
"El PROPIETARIO es el legítimo propietario del alojamiento turístico situado "
"en <strong>[hostpn-accommodation-address]</strong>, <strong>[hostpn-"
"accommodation-city]</strong>."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:299
msgid "The OWNER shall not be liable for the GUEST's personal belongings."
msgstr ""
"El PROPIETARIO no será responsable de las pertenencias personales del "
"HUÉSPED."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:270
msgid "The property must be vacated by the indicated check-out time."
msgstr ""
"La propiedad debe quedar desocupada antes de la hora de salida indicada."

#: includes/class-hostpn-post-type-part.php:976
msgid "The purpose code is taken from each Part (optional)."
msgstr "El código de propósito se toma de cada Parte (opcional)."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:345
msgid ""
"The rent shall be updated annually according to the applicable reference "
"index established by the legislation in force at the time of update."
msgstr ""
"El alquiler se actualizará anualmente de acuerdo con el índice de referencia "
"aplicable establecido por la legislación vigente en el momento de la "
"actualización."

#: includes/class-hostpn-notifications.php:230
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The room %1$s in %2$s is now available. If you are still interested, visit "
"the accommodation page to learn more."
msgstr ""
"La habitación %1$s en %2$s ya está disponible. Si aún le interesa, visite la "
"página de alojamiento para obtener más información."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:268
msgid ""
"The stay is agreed from <strong>[hostpn-contract-start-date]</strong> until "
"<strong>[hostpn-contract-end-date]</strong>."
msgstr ""
"La estancia se acuerda desde el <strong>[hostpn-contract-start-date]</strong>"
" hasta el <strong>[hostpn-contract-end-date]</strong>."

#: includes/class-hostpn-post-type-accommodation.php:2010
#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:239
#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:380
#: templates/public/hostpn-contract-view.php:90
msgid "THE TENANT"
msgstr "EL INQUILINO"

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:209
msgid ""
"The TENANT agrees to respect the basic rules of coexistence with the other "
"flatmates:"
msgstr ""
"El inquilino se compromete a respetar las normas básicas de convivencia con "
"los demás compañeros de piso:"

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:349
msgid ""
"The TENANT delivers <strong>[hostpn-contract-deposit-amount] EUR</strong> "
"([hostpn-contract-deposit-words]) as a legal security deposit (equivalent to "
"one month's rent)."
msgstr ""
"El ARRENDATARIO entrega <strong>[hostpn-contract-deposit-amount] EUR</strong>"
" ([hostpn-contract-deposit-words]) como depósito de garantía legal "
"(equivalente a un mes de alquiler)."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:175
msgid ""
"The TENANT is interested in renting the exclusive use of <strong>Room "
"[hostpn-room-name]</strong> of said property, as well as the right to shared "
"use of the common areas of the flat (kitchen, bathroom and hallways if "
"applicable)."
msgstr ""
"El ARRENDATARIO está interesado en alquilar el uso exclusivo de la <strong>"
"Habitación [hostpn-room-name]</strong> de dicha propiedad, así como el "
"derecho al uso compartido de las áreas comunes del piso (cocina, baño y "
"pasillos, si corresponde)."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:364
msgid ""
"The TENANT may not assign or sublet the property, in whole or in part, "
"without written consent from the LANDLORD."
msgstr ""
"El ARRENDATARIO no podrá ceder ni subarrendar la propiedad, en su totalidad "
"o en parte, sin el consentimiento por escrito del ARRENDADOR."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:360
msgid ""
"The TENANT may not carry out works that alter the layout of the property "
"without written consent from the LANDLORD."
msgstr ""
"El ARRENDATARIO no podrá realizar obras que alteren la distribución de la "
"propiedad sin el consentimiento por escrito del PROPIETARIO."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:218
msgid ""
"The TENANT may not carry out works, modifications or drilling in the walls "
"of the room or common areas without written authorization from the LANDLORD."
msgstr ""
"El ARRENDATARIO no podrá realizar obras, modificaciones ni perforaciones en "
"las paredes de la habitación o en las zonas comunes sin la autorización por "
"escrito del ARRENDADOR."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:369
msgid ""
"The TENANT may withdraw from the contract after six months, by giving 30 "
"days' notice."
msgstr ""
"El arrendatario podrá rescindir el contrato transcurridos seis meses, "
"mediante un preaviso de 30 días."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:182
msgid ""
"The TENANT shall have the right to shared use with the other occupants of "
"the property of the services and common areas: kitchen, bathroom, laundry "
"area and hallways. The exclusive use of any other room in the flat is "
"expressly excluded."
msgstr ""
"El arrendatario tendrá derecho al uso compartido con los demás ocupantes de "
"la propiedad de los servicios y zonas comunes: cocina, baño, lavandería y "
"pasillos. Queda expresamente excluido el uso exclusivo de cualquier otra "
"habitación del piso."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:328
msgid ""
"The TENANT wishes to rent said property as their habitual and permanent "
"residence."
msgstr ""
"El arrendatario desea alquilar dicha propiedad como su residencia habitual y "
"permanente."

#: includes/class-hostpn-contract-templates.php:274
msgid ""
"The total price for the stay is <strong>[hostpn-contract-total-price] "
"EUR</strong>."
msgstr ""
"El precio total de la estancia es <strong>[hostpn-contract-total-price] "
"EUR</strong>."

